sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as React
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant S as ArtifactStore
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant B as Worker

    U->>W: Upload CSV and mapping
    W->>A: POST multipart import
    A->>S: stream staging file + checksum
    A->>D: create import and queued job
    A-->>W: 202 Accepted
    B->>D: claim with SKIP LOCKED
    loop file chunks
        B->>S: read chunk
        B->>D: batch insert
        B->>D: progress and heartbeat
    end
    B->>D: quality report and terminal state
    W->>A: poll job/import
    A-->>W: completed version
